  "visualBrief": "Whole intrinsic architectural ensemble in the contiguous central Cathedral Square, in its intact pre-earthquake2008phase: complete cathedral including tower/spire, nave/aisles/transepts/apse/porches/attached east annexes, the full openwork Chalice, Godley statue with complete plinth/steps and CitizensWarMemorial with cross/plinth/all six figures in their prequake native positions. All principal native exterior rings retained. Adjacent independent hotels/postoffice/library/offices, plaza parcel extrusion, temporary stalls/vehicles/trams/people, lawns/trees and interiors excluded. This is one contiguous civic architectural site, not a collection of separate city sites.",
